* CPMHELP - ORIGINAL CP/M 3 HELP READER

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* CPMHELP - ORIGINAL CP/M 3 HELP READER

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    SYSUTLS:CPMHELP [topic [subtopic]]

Reads the original CP/M 3 indexed HELP.HLP database. It needs a compatible
CP/M 3 help database in its expected search location.

The installed HUMONGOUS HELP.HLP uses HELPC format and is not that
database. Use public HELP for the current online guides; do not replace
those guides with a CP/M 3 database. CPMHELP is retained as a private
compatibility tool.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
